# This file governs the build contexts of merchant-api, x402-gateway and telemetry-dashboard,
# all three of which build from the repository root (see docker-compose.yml).
#
# Docker reads the .dockerignore at the CONTEXT ROOT only. A .dockerignore sitting next to a
# Dockerfile is silently ignored unless it is named <Dockerfile>.dockerignore. Package-level
# copies of this file previously existed for those three services and did nothing at all --
# they were removed. Add exclusions HERE, not beside a Dockerfile.
#
# Every pattern is anchored at the context root, so nested matches need a leading **/ .
# A bare "__pycache__" excludes exactly one directory; "**/__pycache__" excludes all of them.

# --- VCS & CI ---
**/.git
**/.gitignore
.github

# --- Docker's own files (the -f Dockerfile is loaded outside the context, so this is safe) ---
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml

# --- Secrets: never bake an env file into an image layer. .env.example is excluded too,
# because it carries real-shaped Ed25519 seeds and HMAC secrets and no build step reads it.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# --- Node / Next.js ---
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.npm
**/.yarn
**/.pnpm-store
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
# buyerSdkTs/dist is rebuilt from src inside the sdk stage, so the host copy is dead weight.
**/dist
**/out

# --- Python ---
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/.eggs

# --- Tests & coverage. No build stage compiles these, and nothing under any src/ imports
# them, so excluding them cannot affect build output.
tests
**/test
**/tests
**/.pytest_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/coverage.xml

# NOTE: do NOT exclude packages/telemetryDashboard/docs -- the /docs/* pages prerender by
# reading it from disk at build time (src/lib/docsLoader.ts) and the build breaks without it.
# Do NOT exclude next-env.d.ts or .eslintrc.json either; next build consumes both.

# --- Logs, OS & editor noise ---
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/Desktop.ini
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.swp
**/.agents
**/.gemini
